SUMMARY:Mini Golf at Edwards Park
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nYou are convivially invited to a few hours 
 of raucous laughter and abandon while playing your younger-self’s favori
 te game of Mini Golf.\nThis event is for beginners and/or for those who do
  NOT take gaming seriously. This is a ‘social’ event.\nBring yo' funny
 bone!!\n**COST:** $3/game\n**Optional: Lunch after:** (TBD?)\nThis is an 1
 8-hole Mini Golf Course at Edwards Park that includes challenging holes\, 
 a water fall\, and themed features highlighting local historical and touri
 st attractions in Hendersonville\, Henderson County and surrounding commun
 ities\nThe course is ADA-accessible (ADA-accessible holes are #1 - #9 and 
 #18).\n**Amenities:**\nConcession Stand: During Mini Golf operating hours\
 , a concession stand operates to provide players with putters and balls\, 
 as well as offering a variety of snacks and drinks for purchase\nRestrooms
 : Park restroom facilities are available during course operational hours\n
 *https://www.hendersonvillenc.gov/parks/mini-golf-edwards-park*\nWeather C
 heck: Hendersonville\nWeather cancellations will be posted at 6:30am.\nPle
 ase leave Fluffy at home for this one…
