SUMMARY:Hendersonville Community Band
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nThe band will be playing the first concert 
 of the season on October 18 at 3 pm at the Blue Ridge Community College. T
 here will be a variety of selections. Tickets are $12 at the door or at Ar
 ts Council of Henderson County. Students are free. There is also a QR Code
  on the Facebook post for the concert called "Fall Colors" Season Tickets 
 to all four concerts are $40. Follow the signs for the campus location.
